---
import Base from '@/layouts/Base.astro';
const html = "_This Privacy Policy is subject to Hong Kong SAR laws._\n\nYour privacy is important to OneBase and Waylen Allen Limited. This policy explains how we process your personal data and your rights. Personal data is any information that can be connected to you as a private person, for example name and contact information.\n\n## Why we process your data\nTo provide offers and inspiration by newsletter, text message and targeted marketing; to communicate with you and answer your questions; to ask about your experience with us; and to comply with mandatory law (for example consumer and accounting law). You always have the right to object to marketing.\n\n## What we collect\nAccount and profile information; information provided through support channels; content you provide through use of our products or services; communication and marketing preferences; details of transactions, purchases or orders; payment information; device and connection information; information about your use of our platform and mobile app. We may also receive information from our personnel and contractors (Hong Kong, United States, Australia, India), group companies, and business partners and service providers (Hong Kong, United States, Australia, China, India) who provide technical, payment, delivery, advertising, analytics and search services. We do not collect sensitive or special-category data.\n\n## How we use it\nOnly where the law allows: to perform our contract with you; where it satisfies a legitimate interest not overridden by your rights; where you have given consent for a specific purpose (which you may withdraw at any time); or to comply with a legal obligation. We do not share your personal information with any company outside our group for marketing purposes without your express consent.\n\n## How we share it\nWith companies in our group to operate our platform; on an aggregated or de-identified basis for research and analysis; with third-party software providers you choose to connect; with government and law-enforcement officials where required; and with a successor in a merger, acquisition or business transfer, with notice to you.\n\n## Storage and security\nWe use data-hosting providers in Hong Kong, Australia and the USA. Information is encrypted in transit using TLS/SSL; accounts are password-protected; access is restricted to personnel and providers on a need-to-know basis under a duty of confidentiality; practices are reviewed regularly. We retain personal information only as long as reasonably necessary, then delete or anonymise it.\n\n## International transfers\nWe transfer, process and store information outside your country of residence where we or our providers operate, using contractual clauses, corporate rules and other appropriate safeguards.\n\n## Your rights\nTo be informed, to access, to correct, to erase, to restrict or object to processing, to data portability, and to withdraw consent. Contact customerservice@onebasehealth.com.";
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy Policy for OneBase Health (Waylen Allen Limited).">
  <section class="pt-36 pb-24">
    <div class="container-wide max-w-3xl">
      <p class="eyebrow">Policies</p>
      <h1 class="mt-3">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <div class="prose-ob mt-10 text-ob-grey-700" set:html={html.split(/\n\n/).map(b=>b.startsWith("## ")?"<h2>"+b.slice(3)+"</h2>":b.startsWith("_")?"<p><em>"+b.replace(/_/g,"")+"</em></p>":"<p>"+b.replace(/\*\*(.+?)\*\*/g,"<strong>$1</strong>")+"</p>").join("")} />
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
